SUMMARY:Desserts from Around the World
DESCRIPTION:Join us for Desserts from Around the World Fundraiser! during First Friday Gallery Walk\nLive Music\, Dancing\, Silent Auction\, & A Chance to Win a Dessert every 15 minutes!\nHelp us raise $100\,000 by the end of the year! \nShow us your dance moves and take a turn around the world for a chance to win a delicious dessert! \nEach ticket is $25 and gives you 1 entry to participate in the Dessert-walk.\nThere will be three circles of 12 participants each round\, for a total of 36 spots to participate every round.\nRounds will occur every 15 mins starting from 5:30 – 7:45 PM – purchase your tickets for every time slot you want to participate in. \nThe Silent Auction will open online on November 20th and end on December 4th at 8:00 PM \nWine\, beer\, na beverages\, and light refreshments will be available throughout the evening. \nAll desserts are donated by incredible local bakeries\, restaurants\, and dessert makers in our community. If you are interested in donating a dessert please email administrativeassistant@lotusfest.org \nView more info and buy tickets
URL:https://www.lotusfest.org/event/desserts-from-around-the-world/
LOCATION:Lotus Firebay\, 105 S Rogers Street\, Bloomington\, IN\, 47404\, United States
CATEGORIES:Firebay Rental
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/webp:https://www.lotusfest.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/desserts.webp
